T:Now Thank We All Our God
T:NUN DANKET
C:Music: Johann Crüger, 1647 · Words: Martin Rinkart, c.1636. Translated Catherine Winkworth, 1856
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: 'Evangelical Lutheran Hymn-Book', Edition of 1931 Hymn 64.. The hymnary.org score found for comparison (hymnary.org/tune/nun_danket_cruger_555665) is a different tune or version, so the melody follows the Open Hymnal's source.
